  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Rune Arm\n  | name                     = The Disciplinator\n  | reqtrait                 = [[Artificer Rune Arm Use]]\n  | minlevel                 = 9\n  | durability               = 175\n  | material                 = Gem\n  | hardness                 = 19\n  | quest                    = Plane of Night\n  | chest                    = Raid warded chest\n  | end reward               = <!-- only 20ths -->\n  | revamped                 = Update 59\n  | basevalue                = 4,725 pp\n  | weight                   = 0.25 lbs\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoA}}\n  | spell                    = Electrical Lash\n  | target                   = Foe, Directional, Breakable\n  | school                   = Evocation\n  | sr                       = no\n  | spell desc               = Fires a slow-moving ball of electricity that lashes nearby opponents. At higher charge tiers additional enemies are lashed. Opponents struck by this receive a [[Reflex save]] for half damage.\n  | max charge               = <!-- 3 --> 3\n  | imbue                    = Electrical II\n  | imbue die                = 2d4\n  | imbue dmg                = electrical\n  | enhancements             = \n* [[Electrical Lash]]\n* {{Vorpal Weapons|Smiting}}\n* {{Fortification|0|10}}\n* {{Sheltering|13|Enhancement|Physical}}\n* {{Save|Fortitude|5}}\n  | epic                     = no\n  | crafting                 = Essence Crafting\n  | craftingupgrade          = <!--What item can be upgraded to-->\n  | pic                      = Electrical Lash icon.png\n  | picdesc                  = The Disciplinator.png\n  | description              = An unfinished design, Haywire was in the middle of perfecting this rune arm when his foundry exploded. It was meant to keep unruly constructs in line.\n  | tips                     = [[File:The Disciplinator orb.png|center]]\nThis version of Smiting merely destroys a construct on a vorpal (red-named constructs or those with more than 1,000 HP are immune). This does NOT provide the 4d6 bane damage on hit or 100 damage if immune to the insta-kill which normal Smiting weapons include.<br/>\nDisjuncted version:\n[[Image:The Disciplinator disjuncted.png]]\n}}\n[[Category:Draconic Raider's Reward Box items]]",
